{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02545","headline":"奉和初春登楼即目应诏 · 许敬宗","name":"奉和初春登楼即目应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旭日临重壁，天眷极中京。\n春晖发芳甸，佳气满层城。\n去鸟随看没，来云逐望生。\n歌里非烟扬，琴上凯风清。\n文波浮镂槛，摛景焕雕楹。\n璇玑体宽政，隆栋象端衡。\n创规虽有作，凝拱遂无营。\n沐恩空改鬓，将何谢夏成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02545.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02545","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}